  <section id="case" data-screen-label="Case study" style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-default);">
    <div style="max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(56px,8vw,88px) 28px">
      <div style="font:500 12px var(--font-mono);color:var(--color-forest);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:18px">/ Case study</div>
      <h2 style="font:600 var(--type-display-2)/1.08 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0 0 40px;color:var(--color-forest);text-wrap:pretty">A SaaS platform, one query</h2>
      
      <div style="border:1px solid var(--border-default);border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:40px;align-items:flex-start">
        <div style="flex:1 1 380px;max-width:620px">
          <div style="font:500 11px var(--font-mono);color:var(--color-forest);letter-spacing:.14em;margin-bottom:16px">B2B SAAS · SERIES C</div>
          <p style="font:500 var(--type-pull-quote)/1.35 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.015em;color:var(--color-ink);margin:0 0 16px;text-wrap:balance">One unguarded resolver returned every tenant on the platform. It had shipped 14 months earlier.</p>
          <p style="font:400 14.5px/1.6 var(--font-body);color:var(--text-secondary);margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">The team had authorization checks on every REST route and assumed GraphQL inherited them. The global node interface did not. A single introspected query walked the entire customer base. Patched in 48 hours.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;min-width:180px">
          <div><div style="font:700 30px var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--color-forest)">14mo</div><div style="font:500 10px var(--font-mono);color:var(--text-secondary);letter-spacing:.14em;margin-top:4px">UNDETECTED</div></div>
          <div><div style="font:700 30px var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--color-forest)">1</div><div style="font:500 10px var(--font-mono);color:var(--text-secondary);letter-spacing:.14em;margin-top:4px">QUERY TO EXPLOIT</div></div>
          <div><div style="font:700 30px var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--color-forest)">48h</div><div style="font:500 10px var(--font-mono);color:var(--text-secondary);letter-spacing:.14em;margin-top:4px">TO PATCH</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="faq" data-screen-label="FAQ" style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-default);">
